<div class="schedule-area">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row justify-content-start">
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-5">
        <div class="schedule-text mb-xs-20">
          <div class="section-title-register text-right bar-theme-color schedule-title">
            <h3>赶快报名预约课程</h3>
            <span>课程预约</span>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-info justify-content-start">
            <div class="info-content">
              <h6>价格含：教学全部费用，教学期间运动保险</h6>
              <h6>价格不含：学员雪票，租赁装备</h6>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-info justify-content-start">
            <div class="info-content">
              <h6>注1)</h6>
              <h6>教学时间：</h6>
              <h6>2小时：09:30-16:30 中任意2小时</h6>
              <h6>4小时：11:00 - 13:00 &amp; 14:00 - 16:00</h6>
              <h6>6小时：09:30 - 12:30 &amp; 13:30 - 16:30 / 4小时 + 夜场2小时</h6>
              <h6>VIP 6小时：基础6小时 + 雪场接送服务</h6>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-info justify-content-start">
            <div class="info-content">
              <h6>注2)</h6>
              <h6>野泽地区，妙高地区，志贺高原地区，车山高原地区，星野磐梯山地区派遣教学2天起接受预定，价格参考白马地区。</h6>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-info justify-content-start">
            <div class="info-content">
              <h6>注3)</h6>
              <h6>如需在上述地区以外的雪场教学，请联系个别报价。</h6>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-info justify-content-start">
            <div class="info-content">
              <h6>注4)</h6>
              <h6>预定需缴纳50%订金。个人原因取消订金不予退还。</h6>
              <h6>人民币付款按交款当日日元卖出价为准。</h6>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-info justify-content-start">
            <div class="info-content">
              <h6>注5)</h6>
              <h6>此报价适用于2020-2021雪季。JSKI中文国际滑雪学校具有最终解释权。</h6>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-6">
        <div class="schedule-form">
          <form class="schedule-form alert-required">
            <label class="schedule-label">预约人姓名（中文） <span>*</span></label>
            <div class="input-wrap">
              <input id="schedule-name" type="text" placeholder="请输入用户名">
            </div>
            <label class="schedule-label" for="sex">性别 <span>*</span></label>
            <div class="input-wrap input-icon icon-select">
              <select id="sex">
                <option id="sex-default" selected>请选择预约人性别</option>
                <option value="male">男</option>
                <option value="felamle">女</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <label class="schedule-label" for="schedule-place">授课地区 <span>*</span></label>
            <div class="input-wrap input-icon icon-select">
              <select class="schedule-place" id="schedule-place">
                <option id="place-default" selected>请选择授课的地区</option>
                <option value="1">舞子高原滑雪场/栂池高原滑雪场</option>
                <option value="2">汤泽/白马地区其他滑雪场</option>
                <option value="3">其他地区</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <label class="schedule-label" for="schedule-period">课程时长 <span>*</span></label>
            <div class="input-wrap input-icon icon-select schedule-period-wrap">
              <select class="schedule-period" id="schedule-period">
                <option id="period-default" selected>请选择授课的地区</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <label class="schedule-label" for="type">课程种类 <span>*</span></label>
            <div class="input-wrap input-icon icon-select">
              <select id="schedule-type">
                <option id="type-default" selected>请选择课程种类</option>
                <option value="snowboard">单板滑雪</option>
                <option value="ski">双板滑雪</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <label class="schedule-label">课程开始日期 <span>*</span></label>
            <div class="input-wrap">
              <input type="text" class="form-control datetimepicker-input" id="datetimepicker1"
                data-toggle="datetimepicker" data-target="#datetimepicker1" />
            </div>
            <label class="schedule-label-with-small">课程结束日期 <span>*</span></label><br>
            <small class="schedule-small">如选择一天课程，请填写与开始日期相同日期</small>
            <div class="input-wrap">
              <input type="text" class="form-control datetimepicker-input" id="datetimepicker2"
                data-toggle="datetimepicker" data-target="#datetimepicker2" />
            </div>
            <label class="schedule-label-with-small">微信号 <span>*</span></label><br>
            <small class="schedule-small">请填写微信号码（并非微信名称）</small>
            <div class="input-wrap">
              <input type="text" id="schedule-wechat" placeholder="请填写您的微信号码（并非微信名称）">
            </div>
            <label class="schedule-label">手机号 <span>*</span></label>
            <div class="input-wrap">
              <input type="text" id="schedule-phone" placeholder="请填写您的手机号">
            </div>
            <label class="schedule-label">电子邮件 <span>*</span></label>
            <div class="input-wrap">
              <input type="email" id="schedule-email" placeholder="请填写您的电子邮件地址">
            </div>
            <label class="schedule-label">确认电子邮件 <span>*</span></label>
            <div class="input-wrap">
              <input type="email" id="schedule-email-confirm" placeholder="请再次填写您的电子邮件地址">
            </div>
            <label class="schedule-label-with-small">预约渠道 <span>*</span></label><br>
            <small class="schedule-small">请填写您的预约渠道代码，如没有请填写「JSKI」</small>
            <div class="input-wrap">
              <input type="text" id="schedule-channel" placeholder="请填写您的预约渠道代码">
            </div>
            <label class="schedule-label">备注</label>
            <div class="input-wrap">
              <input type="text" id="schedule-note" placeholder="备注">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group form-check mt-4">
              <input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" id="agreement-check">
              <span class="schedule-notice ml-3">同意JSKI的<a href="/participation-notice">参加须知</a>和<a
                  href="/participation-explanation">解释说明</a>。<span>*</span></span>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" id="schedule-submit-button" class="btn btn-gra mt-3" disabled>立即报名 <i
                class="fas fa-angle-double-right"></i>
            </button>
            {{!-- <span class="schedule-notice ml-3">点击报名代表同意JSKI的<a href="/participation-notice">参加须知</a>和<a
                href="/participation-explanation">解释说明</a>。</span> --}}
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>